  (text "Controller 100378. DIO 100197. PiBridge plug is 100204.\nI1 is I/O-list index 0. Channel names are not a confirmed plug order.\nConfirm the 14-pin plug order on the Kunbus drawing before you wire it.\nX4 order 24 V, 0 V, NC, FG is TBC. RS-485 order GND, N, P is TBC.\nThe signal names 24 V, 0 V, FG, P, N and GND are the documented names.\nOPEN: the index sensor order code is not chosen. The symbol is PNP.\nS4 and S5 are VC-CT-6200. S6 is the IDEC HE1B-M1.\nS14 to S17 are the lift limit contacts.\nSpare inputs and outputs stay open.\nETH1 is a service port. Do not put it in the harness.\nThere is no PFC200 and no CODESYS target on this drawing.\n001_0V also on sheet 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9.\n102_PE also on sheet 2, 4, 5, 8.\n211_24C also on sheet 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9.\n420_ESTOP also on sheet 3.\n421_PNOZ also on sheet 3.\n440_S200FB also on sheet 4.\n450_RESET also on sheet 5.\n451_FAULT also on sheet 5.\n452_SONSTO also on sheet 5.\n470_TILT_V also on sheet 7.\n471_TILT_F also on sheet 7.\n490_EXT also on sheet 7.\n491_RET also on sheet 7.\n492_TILTV also on sheet 7.\n493_TILTF also on sheet 7.\n495_ROT_EN also on sheet 8.\n910_A also on sheet 4, 5.\n911_B also on sheet 4, 5.\n930_ETH also on sheet 9." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 292.10 10.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5696274d-d39d-58e7-a5fd-c696ff576be1"))
